{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "5dd6fb88-b8da-461d-9e2d-5cf81c30a7e7",
    "name": "TestesAPIMaratona",
    "description": "## TestesAPIMaratona\n\nThis collection contains the automated tests and exploratory requests for the **Maratona API** — a platform that manages users, teams, and competitive programming problems.\n\n### Structure\n\n- **Cadastros** — Registration requests for users (`POST /cadastro`) and teams (`POST /cadastroTime`).\n    \n- **Pesquisas** — Search and listing requests, organized into three sub-groups:\n    \n    - **Time** — List all teams and search a team by name.\n        \n    - **Usuario** — List all users and search a user by username.\n        \n    - **Problemas** — List and search problems, find users who solved a problem, list problems solved by a user, and get problem recommendations by rating or similarity.\n        \n- **Edicao** — Update operations: user login, add/remove a user from a team, and edit user data.\n    \n- **Deletar** — Delete operations: remove a user and delete a team.\n    \n\n### Authentication\n\nRequests that require authentication use a JWT token stored in the `{{token_jwt}}` environment variable. The base URL is configured via `{{url}}`.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "_exporter_id": "53834297",
    "_collection_link": "https://go.postman.co/collection/53834297-5dd6fb88-b8da-461d-9e2d-5cf81c30a7e7?source=collection_link"
  },
